<title>ESTONIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES - JUNE 16.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES - JUNE 16.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the main headlines reported by Kuku Radio on Monday at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- Tallinn's summer accommodation problems will be eased with the reopening of the Park Hotel, formerly the Kungla.</p>
<p>- The future use of the former Soviet Raadi airstrip in Tartu remains under a question mark.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202/1, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
